Observer Design Pattern

We have the subject(who notifies), observer(who will get notifications)
lets take the example of stock market
lets assume we have two types of observers
1) when price goes above or below a certain level.(PriceAlertListener)
2) when a new stock gets added or any stock has been removed.(DashboardListener)

We have an Eventmanager class here, which has all the event types mapped with their list of listeners in a Map.
(eventType as key and list of listeners as values)
It handles all the activities of adding and removing listeners for an event type, notifying the listeners with the
corresponding runtime listener.

